GET /api/v1/admin/analytics/funnel?startDate=2026-05-01&amp;endDate=2026-05-31 <pre><code>{
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-31",
  "stages": [
    { "name": "page_view", "sessions": 1000, "conversionFromPrevious": null },
    { "name": "product_view", "sessions": 420, "conversionFromPrevious": 42.0 },
    { "name": "add_to_cart", "sessions": 180, "conversionFromPrevious": 42.86 },
    { "name": "checkout_start", "sessions": 90, "conversionFromPrevious": 50.0 },
    { "name": "purchase", "sessions": 45, "conversionFromPrevious": 50.0 }
  ],
  "overallConversion": 4.5
}
</code></pre> <p><code>purchase</code> counts paid, non-canceled orders in the range.</p>

Method Endpoint Description GET <code>/api/v1/api-keys</code> List keys (prefixes only; secrets are never returned) POST <code>/api/v1/api-keys</code> Create a key DELETE <code>/api/v1/api-keys/{id}</code> Revoke a key <p>All three require <code>api_key:manage</code>.</p> <p>Create body:</p> <pre><code>{
  "name": "warehouse-sync",
  "scopes": ["inventory:manage", "order:manage"],
  "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00"
}
</code></pre> <p>Scopes accept the stable permission codes (<code>order:manage</code>, <code>inventory:manage</code>) or legacy <code>Permission</code> enum names (<code>ORDER_MANAGE</code>, <code>INVENTORY_MANAGE</code>). Codes are preferred.</p> <p>The plaintext <code>key</code> is returned only once in <code>ApiKeyCreatedResponse</code>.</p>

POST /api/v1/b2b/account <pre><code>{
  "companyName": "Acme Wholesale",
  "taxId": "TAX-123",
  "contactName": "Alice",
  "phone": "+123456789"
}
</code></pre> <ul> <li>New accounts start <code>PENDING</code>.</li> <li>Re-submitting updates company/contact details without changing approval state.</li> <li><code>GET /api/v1/b2b/account</code> returns credit limit, terms and status.</li> </ul> <p>Admin approval:</p> <pre><code>{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "creditLimit": 5000.00,
  "paymentTermsDays": 30
}
</code></pre>

POST /api/v1/b2b/quotes <pre><code>{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "product-a", "quantity": 10 },
    { "productId": "product-b", "quantity": 5 }
  ],
  "notes": "Please quote wholesale pricing",
  "validDays": 14
}
</code></pre> <ul> <li>Requires an <code>APPROVED</code> B2B account.</li> <li>All items must belong to one seller/shop.</li> <li>Initial prices use the product price/discount price.</li> </ul> <p>Seller response:</p> PUT /api/v1/seller/b2b/quotes/{id} <pre><code>{
  "status": "SENT",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "product-a", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 8.50 },
    { "productId": "product-b", "quantity": 5, "unitPrice": 12.00 }
  ],
  "validUntil": "2026-06-15T00:00:00"
}
</code></pre> <p><code>status</code> may be <code>SENT</code> or <code>REJECTED</code>. Only the quote's seller can respond.</p> <p>Other endpoints:</p> <ul> <li><code>GET /api/v1/b2b/quotes</code></li> <li><code>GET /api/v1/b2b/quotes/{id}</code></li> <li><code>GET /api/v1/seller/b2b/quotes</code></li> </ul>

